@startuml US_3_1_4_Process
title US 3.1.4 - Feedback de ações

actor User
participant Page as "Page/Form (ex.: DocksComponent)"
participant Service as "DocksService (fetch)"
participant Toast as "ToastService"
participant API as "TodoApi"

User -> Page: Submete formulário
Page -> Service: POST /api/Docks
Service -> API: HTTP POST (withCredentials)
API --> Service: 204 ou erro c/ JSON
Service --> Page: resultado
Page -> Page: validar campos locais\nmostrar erros junto aos inputs
alt sucesso
  Page -> Toast: success("Dock criado")
  Page --> User: Lista atualizada / loading off
else erro
  Page -> Toast: error(message amigável)
  Page --> User: Mensagens de validação nos campos\nloading off
end

@enduml
